# The build context is the repository root, so that the image can copy the
# installer from the one place it lives — scripts/install/install.sh —
# rather than keeping a second copy under website/ that would drift.
#
# Everything is excluded and the two directories the image needs are added
# back, which keeps the context at a few hundred KB instead of the whole
# repository.
*

!website/public
!website/nginx.conf
!website/security-headers.conf
!scripts/install/install.sh

# Not needed inside the image even from those paths.
website/README.md
